ect/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0033.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0033","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0033.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0033.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4cd396b19740b190e20a751f70ba95337b29a465/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4gxc-2493-86w6/GHSA-4gxc-2493-86w6.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0033.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/c9b68d7e9fee580d97403fe7a317626fdb0fba2c/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0027","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0029","title":"UnixWare pis/mkpis 命令符号链接本地权限提升漏洞","description":"UnixWare 操作系统的 pis 和 mkpis 命令存在权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者可通过符号链接（symlink）攻击方式，在程序处理临时文件时诱导其以高权限覆盖或读取任意文件，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 UnixWare 多个版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中等。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0029"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:51Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 UnixWare 至针对此漏洞的补丁版本（7.1.1 及以上安全更新），或从 SCO 官方 ftp 获取 pis/mkpis 补丁。临时缓解措施：移除 pis 与 mkpis 命令的 setuid 权限位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/pis /usr/bin/mkpis），阻止本地普通用户以更高权限执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94780294009285&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/901","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0029.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0029","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0029.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0029.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c32de14d223251fcc47138cf2f2d457787b2173f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8m9f-gvrp-3wgm/GHSA-8m9f-gvrp-3wgm.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0029.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/c9b68d7e9fee580d97403fe7a317626fdb0fba2c/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0049","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0060","title":"aVirt Rover POP3 Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"aVirt Rover POP3 Server 1.1 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 POP3 服务发送超长的用户名（USER）命令参数触发该漏洞，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用条件简单，无需身份认证，仅需建立 TCP 连接即可实施攻击。CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0060"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-12-27T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"aVirt Rover POP3 Server 1.1 已停止维护，官方未发布安全补丁。建议立即迁移至仍在活跃维护的 POP3 服务软件（如 Dovecot 或 Cyrus），并在防火墙策略中限制对 110/TCP 端口的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任客户端连接。同时可在应用层限制用户名输入长度以缓解缓冲区溢出风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94633851427858&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94647711311057&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/3765.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/894"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0025","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0027","title":"IBM Network Station Manager 2.0 R1 竞争条件漏洞","description":"IBM Network Station Manager 2.0 R1（NetStation）存在本地竞争条件漏洞，通过符号链接攻击（symlink attack）实现权限提升。本地攻击者可利用 NetStation 在处理临时文件时存在的竞态条件，诱导程序访问恶意构造的符号链接文件，从而以更高权限执行任意操作。该漏洞影响 IBM Network Station Manager 2.0 R1 版本，攻击复杂度较高，需要本地系统访问权限，一旦成功利用可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0027"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-27T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-12-27T00:00:00Z","remediation":"IBM Network Station Manager 2.0 R1 已停止维护，官方不再提供补丁。建议升级至不受影响的版本（如 3.0 及以上），或将管理界面限制在受信任内网，通过防火墙/ACL 仅允许管理 IP 访问 TCP 端口 2301，并禁用不必要的远程管理功能以降低竞争条件被利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19697","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0027.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0027","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0027.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e13895