T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0008","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2000/CVE-2000-0008.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0008.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0008","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/2297c357ff5ff64d3949208296fbd1252169cc37/2000/CVE-2000-0008.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0008.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0008.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1790/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--02e47c55-93fc-4f6f-853f-d254db309896.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0007","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0006","title":"strace 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"strace 是一款 Linux/Unix 系统下的系统调用跟踪调试工具，其在处理内存映射文件名时存在缺陷，导致本地普通用户可利用 strace 跟踪其他进程系统调用的功能，通过构造特定的内存映射文件名来读取任意文件内容。该漏洞影响 strace 多个版本，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用，危害等级较低。厂商已发布修复版本，建议用户升级至最新版 strace。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0006"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:48Z","remediation":"strace 4.4 之前的版本在解析 /proc/self/maps 时未正确限制内存映射文件名的读取权限，导致本地低权限用户可通过 trojan 程序配合 strace 读取任意文件内容。建议将 strace 升级至 4.4 或更高版本；如无法升级，应移除 strace 的 suid 权限位（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/strace`）并限制仅 root 用户可执行，同时避免在多用户环境下赋予不可信用户 strace 执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/39831","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4554","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0006.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0006","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/753195abd6c649ec631ec3b8f5760dfa888c0829/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/conf/distro/include/cve-extra-exclusions.inc","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0006.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0006.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/04/seguranca/cve-2000-0006-strace-allows-local-users-to-read-ar-1767537313000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fmp9-jf38-4px4/GHSA-fmp9-jf38-4px4.json","https://github.com/openembedded/openembedded-core/blob/a4eb7bc2a750f76d9772eb88b7afb2b801bd1250/meta/conf/distro/include/cve-extra-exclusions.inc","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/a83313f052bb2e5233541fa72d03772d59c63a86/osv/AZL-35286.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0088","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0040","title":"glFtpD SITE ZIPCHK 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"glFTPD 存在本地权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者通过在 SITE ZIPCHK 命令中插入元字符（metacharacters）可执行任意系统命令，从而获取更高权限。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的命令参数进行充分过滤或转义，攻击者需拥有本地账户即可利用，成功利用后可提升至 root 权限，完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0040"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:52Z","remediation":"立即升级 glFTPd 至 1.24 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SITE ZIPCHK 命令中元字符未正确转义的问题。如无法升级，在 glftpd.conf 中禁用 SITE ZIPCHK 命令（添加 deny SITE ZIPCHK 规则），并确保 FTP 用户使用 chroot 限制目录访问权限，降低提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0040","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0040.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0040.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0040","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/cf818d3668155ee14907188346fea9ac5f2014db/2000/CVE-2000-0040.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0040/README.md","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1921.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0040.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w4rv-5mh3-w9fg/GHSA-w4rv-5mh3-w9fg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0040.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/ftp.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0077","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0038","title":"glFTPd 1.17.2 默认后门账户远程代码执行漏洞","description":"glFTPd 1.17.2 版本存在默认后门账号漏洞。该 FTP 服务器软件在安装时内置了一个名为 glftpd 的默认用户账号，其密码为固定值且用户 UID 被设置为 0（即 root 权限）。攻击者无需任何身份认证，即可通过网络远程连接到目标服务器的 FTP 端口，使用该默认账号密码登录系统，从而获得服务器的 root 级别完全控制权限，可执行任意代码、读取或篡改敏感文件。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0038"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:52Z","remediation":"立即升级 glFTPd 至 2.0 及以上版本（最新为 v2.16），旧版 1.17.2 内置了 UID 为 0 的默认管理员账户 glftpd 及已知默认密码。如无法升级，手动删除或禁用 glftpd 用户账号，修改 /etc/glftpd/ftpusers 中所有默认账户的密码，并检查是否存在其他 UID 0 的非授权账号。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0038","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19690","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0038.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0038.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0038","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/cf818d3668155ee14907188346fea9ac5f2014db/2000/CVE-2000-0038.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0038.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0038.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88216/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/cee5a3b524678beb8613152453ffdb7e3eac41b4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0026","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0028","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 跨帧安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.0、5.0 及 5.01 版本中的 external.NavigateAndFind 函数存在跨帧安全策略绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可构造恶意网页，诱导用户访问后绕过同源策略限制，跨帧读取目标系统上的本地文件。该漏洞利用条件简单，仅需用户使用受影响浏览器访问攻击者控制的页面即可触发。由于当时 IE 浏览器市场占有率极高，该漏洞影响范围广泛。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0028"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:51Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 6.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 IE 6.0 及后续版本中修复。由于 IE 5.x 系列已停止技术支持且不再获得安全更新，强烈建议升级到 Microsoft Edge 或现代第三方浏览器（如 Chrome/Firefox）。如因系统限制无法升级浏览器，可禁用 Active Scripting 并在 Internet 安全区域设置为高作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0028","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19686","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0028.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0028.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0028","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/cf818d3668155ee14907188346fea9ac5f2014db/2000/CVE-2000-0028.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0028.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0028.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000962.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0026.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0026.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0003","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0001","title":"RealNetworks RealServer 5.0 ramgen 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealServer 5.0 的 ramgen 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向目标服务器发送特制的超长 ramgen 请求，导致 RealServer 服务崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RealNetworks RealServer 5.0 版本，攻击条件简单，仅需向目标 80/8080 端口发送恶意构造的 HTTP 请求即可触发，无需任何权限。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0001"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:47Z","remediation":"建议升级至 RealNetworks RealServer 5.0.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ramgen 组件对超长请求的缓冲区处理。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层限制请求 URI 长度不超过 1024 字节，并过滤对 /ramgen 路径的异常请求以缓解 DoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/888","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19687","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2000/CVE-2000-0001.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0001.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d51